#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, you'll build a Next.js app where users can log in with their AT Protocol identity using OAuth. If you [host your own PDS](/guides/self-hosting), that means you can provide your own auth source for any apps in the Atmosphere.\n"
msgstr "このチュートリアルでは、OAuthを使ってユーザーがATプロトコルのIDでログインできるNext.jsアプリを作成します。[自分のPDSをホスト](/guides/self-hosting)している場合、Atmosphere上の任意のアプリに対して独自の認証ソースを提供できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can find the source code for this tutorial, along with other example projects, in the [Cookbook](https://github.com/bluesky-social/cookbook/) repository, under `nextjs-oauth`.\n"
msgstr "このチュートリアルのソースコードは、他のサンプルプロジェクトとあわせて[Cookbook](https://github.com/bluesky-social/cookbook/)リポジトリの`nextjs-oauth`にあります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "This OAuth tutorial does not use many Atproto concepts or dependencies. You should have a working understanding of Next.js and TypeScript.\n"
msgstr "このOAuthチュートリアルではAtprotoの概念や依存関係をあまり使いません。Next.jsとTypeScriptの実用的な理解があることを前提とします。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You should have installed:\n"
"- Node.js 20+\n"
"- The pnpm package manager\n"
msgstr ""
"以下をインストールしておいてください。\n"
"- Node.js 20以上\n"
"- pnpmパッケージマネージャー\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "On platforms supported by [homebrew](https://brew.sh/), you can install these with:\n"
msgstr "[homebrew](https://brew.sh/)に対応したプラットフォームでは、次のコマンドでインストールできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"brew install node pnpm\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"brew install node pnpm\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 1: Project Setup\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-1-project-setup\">パート1：セットアップ</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll start by creating a new Next.js project using the `create-next-app` command.\n"
msgstr "まず`create-next-app`コマンドで新しいNext.jsプロジェクトを作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"npx create-next-app@latest my-app --yes\n"
"cd my-app\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"npx create-next-app@latest my-app --yes\n"
"cd my-app\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, add the `oauth-client-node` package from the Atproto ecosystem, which provides OAuth client functionality.\n"
msgstr "次に、OAuthクライアント機能を提供するAtprotoエコシステムの`oauth-client-node`パッケージを追加します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"pnpm add @atproto/oauth-client-node\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"pnpm add @atproto/oauth-client-node\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "That's all you need to get started! You can now run the development server with:\n"
msgstr "準備はこれで完了です。次のコマンドで開発サーバーを起動できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:51 src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:435
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:648
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"pnpm dev\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"pnpm dev\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your app in a browser at [http://127.0.0.1:3000](http://127.0.0.1:3000).\n"
msgstr "ブラウザで[http://127.0.0.1:3000](http://127.0.0.1:3000)にアクセスしてください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Note>\n"
"In general, when working with OAuth, you should use `127.0.0.1` URLs instead of `localhost`. This will be important for the OAuth redirect flow to work correctly.\n"
"</Note>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Note>\n"
"一般に、OAuthを使用する場合は`localhost`ではなく`127.0.0.1`のURLを使用する必要があります。これは、OAuthリダイレクトフローが正しく機能するために重要です。\n"
"</Note>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "You should receive the Next.js starter page:\n"
msgstr "Next.jsのスターターページが表示されるはずです。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={starter} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={starter} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, you'll implement baseline OAuth functionality.\n"
msgstr "次に、基本となるOAuth機能を実装します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 2: Implementing OAuth\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-2-implementing-oauth\">パート2：OAuthの実装</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll start out implementing OAuth using a local *loopback* client with in-memory storage.\n"
msgstr "まず、インメモリストレージを使うローカルの*ループバック*クライアントでOAuthを実装します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "OAuth loopback works by using a special redirect URI (like http://127.0.0.1:PORT/callback) to send authorization codes directly back to an app, which listens on a local port, avoiding browser-based callbacks and enabling secure, direct communication for token exchange. Instead of a web redirect, the app opens a local listener, you can auth in a browser, and the server redirects back to the app's local URI, letting the app grab the code and exchange it for a token. It's particularly useful for development scenarios.\n"
msgstr "OAuthループバックは、特別なリダイレクトURI（例：`http://127.0.0.1:PORT/callback`）を使って認可コードをアプリへ直接返す仕組みです。アプリはローカルポートで待ち受けるため、ブラウザベースのコールバックを避けつつ安全にトークン交換できます。ウェブへのリダイレクトの代わりに、アプリがローカルリスナーを開き、ブラウザで認証したあとサーバーがアプリのローカルURIに戻すことで、アプリがコードを受け取ってトークンに交換します。特に開発時に有用です。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "To do this, you'll implement a [confidential client](/specs/oauth#types-of-clients). Your Next.js server will hold credentials for talking to a user's PDS. The server will verify incoming requests from the browser using cookies for session auth.\n"
msgstr "これをするために[機密クライアント](/specs/oauth#types-of-clients)を実装します。Next.jsサーバーがユーザーのPDSと通信するための資格情報を保持し、ブラウザからのリクエストをクッキーでセッション認証して検証します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create `lib/auth/client.ts`:\n"
msgstr "まず`lib/auth/client.ts`を作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import {\n"
"  NodeOAuthClient,\n"
"  buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
"import type {\n"
"  NodeSavedSession,\n"
"  NodeSavedState,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import {\n"
"  NodeOAuthClient,\n"
"  buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
"import type {\n"
"  NodeSavedSession,\n"
"  NodeSavedState,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:87 src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:700
#, no-wrap
msgid "export const SCOPE = \"atproto\";\n"
msgstr "export const SCOPE = \"atproto\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Use globalThis to persist across Next.js hot reloads\n"
"const globalAuth = globalThis as unknown as {\n"
"  stateStore: Map<string, NodeSavedState>;\n"
"  sessionStore: Map<string, NodeSavedSession>;\n"
"};\n"
"globalAuth.stateStore ??= new Map();\n"
"globalAuth.sessionStore ??= new Map();\n"
msgstr ""
"// Next.jsのホットリロードで消えないよう、globalThisを使います\n"
"const globalAuth = globalThis as unknown as {\n"
"  stateStore: Map<string, NodeSavedState>;\n"
"  sessionStore: Map<string, NodeSavedSession>;\n"
"};\n"
"globalAuth.stateStore ??= new Map();\n"
"globalAuth.sessionStore ??= new Map();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:97 src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:702
#, no-wrap
msgid "let client: NodeOAuthClient | null = null;\n"
msgstr "let client: NodeOAuthClient | null = null;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:100
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function getOAuthClient(): Promise<NodeOAuthClient> {\n"
"  if (client) return client;\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function getOAuthClient(): Promise<NodeOAuthClient> {\n"
"  if (client) return client;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  client = new NodeOAuthClient({\n"
"    clientMetadata: buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata({\n"
"      scope: SCOPE,\n"
"      redirect_uris: [\"http://127.0.0.1:3000/oauth/callback\"],\n"
"    }),\n"
msgstr ""
"  client = new NodeOAuthClient({\n"
"    clientMetadata: buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata({\n"
"      scope: SCOPE,\n"
"      redirect_uris: [\"http://127.0.0.1:3000/oauth/callback\"],\n"
"    }),\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:118
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    stateStore: {\n"
"      async get(key: string) {\n"
"        return globalAuth.stateStore.get(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedState) {\n"
"        globalAuth.stateStore.set(key, value);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async del(key: string) {\n"
"        globalAuth.stateStore.delete(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"    },\n"
msgstr ""
"    stateStore: {\n"
"      async get(key: string) {\n"
"        return globalAuth.stateStore.get(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedState) {\n"
"        globalAuth.stateStore.set(key, value);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async del(key: string) {\n"
"        globalAuth.stateStore.delete(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"    },\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:131
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    sessionStore: {\n"
"      async get(key: string) {\n"
"        return globalAuth.sessionStore.get(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedSession) {\n"
"        globalAuth.sessionStore.set(key, value);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async del(key: string) {\n"
"        globalAuth.sessionStore.delete(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"    },\n"
"  });\n"
msgstr ""
"    sessionStore: {\n"
"      async get(key: string) {\n"
"        return globalAuth.sessionStore.get(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedSession) {\n"
"        globalAuth.sessionStore.set(key, value);\n"
"      },\n"
"      async del(key: string) {\n"
"        globalAuth.sessionStore.delete(key);\n"
"      },\n"
"    },\n"
"  });\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:135
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  return client;\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"  return client;\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "`stateStore` is temporary storage using during the OAuth flow; `sessionStore` is persistent storage keyed by a user's DID. The `globalThis` pattern is a standard Next.js technique for persisting data across hot module reloads in development. Without this, the in-memory stores would be wiped every time you edit a file.\n"
msgstr "`stateStore`はOAuthフロー中に使う一時ストレージ、`sessionStore`はユーザーDIDをキーにした永続ストレージです。`globalThis`パターンは、開発中のホットリロードをまたいでデータを保持するためのNext.jsの定番手法です。これがないと、ファイル編集のたびにインメモリストアが消えます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "AT Protocol OAuth has a special carveout for local development. The `client_id` must be `localhost` and the `redirect_uri` must be on host 127.0.0.1. Read more in the [Localhost Client Development specs](/specs/oauth#localhost-client-development).\n"
msgstr "ATプロトコルOAuthにはローカル開発向けの特例があります。`client_id`は`localhost`、`redirect_uri`のホストは127.0.0.1である必要があります。詳細は仕様の[Localhost Client Development](/specs/oauth#localhost-client-development)を参照してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:143
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Note>\n"
"There's no way around it — this section of the tutorial is pretty dry! You'll be implementing standard OAuth flows, which are inherently boilerplate-heavy. But once you have this baseline working, you'll be able to build on top of it!\n"
"</Note>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Note>\n"
"これは避けられないことですが、チュートリアルのこのセクションはかなり無味乾燥なものです。標準のOAuthフローを実装することになりますが、これは本質的に定型的な負荷がかかります。ただし、このベースラインが機能すると、その上に構築できるようになります。\n"
"</Note>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, create `lib/auth/session.ts` to manage user sessions:\n"
msgstr "次に、ユーザーセッションを管理する`lib/auth/session.ts`を作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { cookies } from \"next/headers\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"./client\";\n"
"import type { OAuthSession } from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { cookies } from \"next/headers\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"./client\";\n"
"import type { OAuthSession } from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:154
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function getSession(): Promise<OAuthSession | null> {\n"
"  const did = await getDid();\n"
"  if (!did) return null;\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function getSession(): Promise<OAuthSession | null> {\n"
"  const did = await getDid();\n"
"  if (!did) return null;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:162
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  try {\n"
"    const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
"    return await client.restore(did);\n"
"  } catch {\n"
"    return null;\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"  try {\n"
"    const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
"    return await client.restore(did);\n"
"  } catch {\n"
"    return null;\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:168
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function getDid(): Promise<string | null> {\n"
"  const cookieStore = await cookies();\n"
"  return cookieStore.get(\"did\")?.value ?? null;\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function getDid(): Promise<string | null> {\n"
"  const cookieStore = await cookies();\n"
"  return cookieStore.get(\"did\")?.value ?? null;\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then, create `app/oauth/login/route.ts`. This route initiates the login flow. You only need the user's handle — with it, you can resolve the user's Authorization Server (their PDS) and redirect them there:\n"
msgstr "続いて`app/oauth/login/route.ts`を作成します。このルートはログインフローを開始します。必要なのはユーザーのハンドルだけで、そこからユーザーの認可サーバー（PDS）へ解決してリダイレクトできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:174
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient, SCOPE } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient, SCOPE } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:178
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const { handle } = await request.json();\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const { handle } = await request.json();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:185
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    if (!handle || typeof handle !== \"string\") {\n"
"      return NextResponse.json(\n"
"        { error: \"Handle is required\" },\n"
"        { status: 400 }\n"
"      );\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    if (!handle || typeof handle !== \"string\") {\n"
"      return NextResponse.json(\n"
"        { error: \"Handle is required\" },\n"
"        { status: 400 }\n"
"      );\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:187
#, no-wrap
msgid "    const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
msgstr "    const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:192
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    // Resolves handle, finds their auth server, returns authorization URL\n"
"    const authUrl = await client.authorize(handle, {\n"
"      scope: SCOPE,\n"
"    });\n"
msgstr ""
"    // ハンドルを解決し、認可サーバーを見つけ、認可URLを返す\n"
"    const authUrl = await client.authorize(handle, {\n"
"      scope: SCOPE,\n"
"    });\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:203
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    return NextResponse.json({ redirectUrl: authUrl.toString() });\n"
"  } catch (error) {\n"
"    console.error(\"OAuth login error:\", error);\n"
"    return NextResponse.json(\n"
"      { error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : \"Login failed\" },\n"
"      { status: 500 }\n"
"    );\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"    return NextResponse.json({ redirectUrl: authUrl.toString() });\n"
"  } catch (error) {\n"
"    console.error(\"OAuth login error:\", error);\n"
"    return NextResponse.json(\n"
"      { error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : \"Login failed\" },\n"
"      { status: 500 }\n"
"    );\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:205
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a user approves the authorization consent screen, they'll be redirected to a callback route. Here, you'll exchange the code from the redirect for actual credentials, then set a cookie for the user's DID. Create `app/oauth/callback/route.ts`:\n"
msgstr "ユーザーが同意画面で認可を許可すると、コールバックルートへリダイレクトされます。ここでリダイレクトで受け取ったコードを実際の認証情報に交換し、ユーザーDIDのクッキーを設定します。`app/oauth/callback/route.ts`を作成してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:209
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:211
#, no-wrap
msgid "const PUBLIC_URL = process.env.PUBLIC_URL || \"http://127.0.0.1:3000\";\n"
msgstr "const PUBLIC_URL = process.env.PUBLIC_URL || \"http://127.0.0.1:3000\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:216
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function GET(request: NextRequest) {\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const params = request.nextUrl.searchParams;\n"
"    const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function GET(request: NextRequest) {\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const params = request.nextUrl.searchParams;\n"
"    const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:219
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    // Exchange code for session\n"
"    const { session } = await client.callback(params);\n"
msgstr ""
"    // コードを交換してセッション取得\n"
"    const { session } = await client.callback(params);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:221
#, no-wrap
msgid "    const response = NextResponse.redirect(new URL(\"/\", PUBLIC_URL));\n"
msgstr "    const response = NextResponse.redirect(new URL(\"/\", PUBLIC_URL));\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:230
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    // Set DID cookie\n"
"    response.cookies.set(\"did\", session.did, {\n"
"      httpOnly: true,\n"
"      secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === \"production\",\n"
"      sameSite: \"lax\",\n"
"      maxAge: 60 * 60 * 24 * 7, // 1 week\n"
"      path: \"/\",\n"
"    });\n"
msgstr ""
"    // DIDクッキーを設定\n"
"    response.cookies.set(\"did\", session.did, {\n"
"      httpOnly: true,\n"
"      secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === \"production\",\n"
"      sameSite: \"lax\",\n"
"      maxAge: 60 * 60 * 24 * 7, // 1 week\n"
"      path: \"/\",\n"
"    });\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:238
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    return response;\n"
"  } catch (error) {\n"
"    console.error(\"OAuth callback error:\", error);\n"
"    return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(\"/?error=login_failed\", PUBLIC_URL));\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"    return response;\n"
"  } catch (error) {\n"
"    console.error(\"OAuth callback error:\", error);\n"
"    return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(\"/?error=login_failed\", PUBLIC_URL));\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:240
#, no-wrap
msgid "`PUBLIC_URL` falls back to `127.0.0.1:3000` to ensure you always redirect to the correct host. This avoids cookie issues that arise from `localhost` vs `127.0.0.1` mismatches.\n"
msgstr "`PUBLIC_URL`は`127.0.0.1:3000`にフォールバックして、常に正しいホストへリダイレクトするようにしています。これにより`localhost`と`127.0.0.1`の不一致で発生するクッキー問題を回避できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:242
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, you should also create a logout route at `app/oauth/logout/route.ts` to clear the user's session:\n"
msgstr "次に、ユーザーセッションをクリアするため`app/oauth/logout/route.ts`にログアウトルートも作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:247
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { cookies } from \"next/headers\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { cookies } from \"next/headers\";\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:252
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function POST() {\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const cookieStore = await cookies();\n"
"    const did = cookieStore.get(\"did\")?.value;\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function POST() {\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const cookieStore = await cookies();\n"
"    const did = cookieStore.get(\"did\")?.value;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:257
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    if (did) {\n"
"      const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
"      await client.revoke(did);\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    if (did) {\n"
"      const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
"      await client.revoke(did);\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:268
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    cookieStore.delete(\"did\");\n"
"    return NextResponse.json({ success: true });\n"
"  } catch (error) {\n"
"    console.error(\"Logout error:\", error);\n"
"    const cookieStore = await cookies();\n"
"    cookieStore.delete(\"did\");\n"
"    return NextResponse.json({ success: true });\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"    cookieStore.delete(\"did\");\n"
"    return NextResponse.json({ success: true });\n"
"  } catch (error) {\n"
"    console.error(\"Logout error:\", error);\n"
"    const cookieStore = await cookies();\n"
"    cookieStore.delete(\"did\");\n"
"    return NextResponse.json({ success: true });\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:270
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, you'll make one last route, to expose the `oauth-client-metadata.json` at a well-known URL. This is [used in ATProto OAuth](/specs/oauth#clients) to discover client configuration. Create `app/oauth-client-metadata.json/route.ts`:\n"
msgstr "最後にもう1つルートを作成し、`oauth-client-metadata.json`をwell-known URLで公開します。これはAtproto OAuthでクライアント設定の検出に[使われます](/specs/oauth#clients)。`app/oauth-client-metadata.json/route.ts`を作成してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:274
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"
"import { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { getOAuthClient } from \"@/lib/auth/client\";\n"
"import { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:277
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// The URL of this endpoint IS your client_id\n"
"// Authorization servers fetch this to learn about your app\n"
msgstr ""
"// このエンドポイントのURLがclient_idになる\n"
"// 認可サーバーはこの情報を取得してアプリ設定を把握する\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:283
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function GET() {\n"
"  const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
"  return NextResponse.json(client.clientMetadata);\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function GET() {\n"
"  const client = await getOAuthClient();\n"
"  return NextResponse.json(client.clientMetadata);\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:285
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can visit http://127.0.0.1:3000/oauth-client-metadata.json to see your client configuration.\n"
msgstr "http://127.0.0.1:3000/oauth-client-metadata.json にアクセスすると、クライアント設定を確認できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:289
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={metadata} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={metadata} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:291
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now you just need to add a few forms. Create `components/LoginForm.tsx`:\n"
msgstr "あとはフォームをいくつか追加するだけです。`components/LoginForm.tsx`を作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:294 src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:362
#: src/guides/statusphere-tutorial/en.mdx:189
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```tsx\n"
"\"use client\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```tsx\n"
"\"use client\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:296
#, no-wrap
msgid "import { useState } from \"react\";\n"
msgstr "import { useState } from \"react\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:301
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export function LoginForm() {\n"
"  const [handle, setHandle] = useState(\"\");\n"
"  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n"
"  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n"
msgstr ""
"export function LoginForm() {\n"
"  const [handle, setHandle] = useState(\"\");\n"
"  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n"
"  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:306
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  async function handleSubmit(e: React.FormEvent) {\n"
"    e.preventDefault();\n"
"    setLoading(true);\n"
"    setError(null);\n"
msgstr ""
"  async function handleSubmit(e: React.FormEvent) {\n"
"    e.preventDefault();\n"
"    setLoading(true);\n"
"    setError(null);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:313
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    try {\n"
"      const res = await fetch(\"/oauth/login\", {\n"
"        method: \"POST\",\n"
"        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n"
"        body: JSON.stringify({ handle }),\n"
"      });\n"
msgstr ""
"    try {\n"
"      const res = await fetch(\"/oauth/login\", {\n"
"        method: \"POST\",\n"
"        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n"
"        body: JSON.stringify({ handle }),\n"
"      });\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:315
#, no-wrap
msgid "      const data = await res.json();\n"
msgstr "      const data = await res.json();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:319
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      if (!res.ok) {\n"
"        throw new Error(data.error || \"Login failed\");\n"
"      }\n"
msgstr ""
"      if (!res.ok) {\n"
"        throw new Error(data.error || \"Login failed\");\n"
"      }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:327
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      // Redirect to authorization server\n"
"      window.location.href = data.redirectUrl;\n"
"    } catch (err) {\n"
"      setError(err instanceof Error ? err.message : \"Login failed\");\n"
"      setLoading(false);\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"      // 認可サーバーにリダイレクト\n"
"      window.location.href = data.redirectUrl;\n"
"    } catch (err) {\n"
"      setError(err instanceof Error ? err.message : \"Login failed\");\n"
"      setLoading(false);\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:343
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  return (\n"
"    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\"space-y-4\">\n"
"      <div>\n"
"        <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mb-1\">\n"
"          Handle\n"
"        </label>\n"
"        <input\n"
"          type=\"text\"\n"
"          value={handle}\n"
"          onChange={(e) => setHandle(e.target.value)}\n"
"          placeholder=\"user.example.com\"\n"
"          className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\"\n"
"          disabled={loading}\n"
"        />\n"
"      </div>\n"
msgstr ""
"  return (\n"
"    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\"space-y-4\">\n"
"      <div>\n"
"        <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mb-1\">\n"
"          Handle\n"
"        </label>\n"
"        <input\n"
"          type=\"text\"\n"
"          value={handle}\n"
"          onChange={(e) => setHandle(e.target.value)}\n"
"          placeholder=\"user.example.com\"\n"
"          className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\"\n"
"          disabled={loading}\n"
"        />\n"
"      </div>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:345
#, no-wrap
msgid "      {error && <p className=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{error}</p>}\n"
msgstr "      {error && <p className=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{error}</p>}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:357
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      <button\n"
"        type=\"submit\"\n"
"        disabled={loading || !handle}\n"
"        className=\"w-full py-2 px-4 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 disabled:opacity-50\"\n"
"      >\n"
"        {loading ? \"Signing in...\" : \"Sign in\"}\n"
"      </button>\n"
"    </form>\n"
"  );\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"      <button\n"
"        type=\"submit\"\n"
"        disabled={loading || !handle}\n"
"        className=\"w-full py-2 px-4 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 disabled:opacity-50\"\n"
"      >\n"
"        {loading ? \"Signing in...\" : \"Sign in\"}\n"
