#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:429
#, no-wrap
msgid "At this point, you should be able to test the OAuth flow!\n"
msgstr "この時点でOAuthフローをテストできるはずです。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:431
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your app isn't already running from Part 1, start it with:\n"
msgstr "パート1からアプリをまだ起動していない場合は、次のように起動します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:441
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then:\n"
"1. Navigate to your app in a browser at [http://127.0.0.1:3000](http://127.0.0.1:3000).\n"
"2. Enter your handle\n"
"3. Authorize the app\n"
"4. You should see \"Authentication working!\" with your DID:\n"
msgstr ""
"1. ブラウザで[http://127.0.0.1:3000](http://127.0.0.1:3000)にアクセスする\n"
"2. ハンドルを入力する\n"
"3. アプリを認可する\n"
"4. DIDとともに\"Authentication working!\"と表示される\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:445
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={workingauth} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Container>\n"
"  <Image src={workingauth} alt=\"\" className=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\" />\n"
"</Container>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:447
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations — you've now implemented working OAuth as a baseline, and can move on to more exciting features.\n"
msgstr "おめでとうございます。これで動作するOAuthの土台ができたので、次はより発展的な機能に進めます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:449
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 3: Adding Database Persistence\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-3-adding-database-persistence\">パート3：データベース永続化の追加</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:451
#, no-wrap
msgid "The in-memory approach used so far works for local development, but for production you'll want a proper database. Let's add SQLite and some other dependencies to manage this:\n"
msgstr "ここまで使ってきたインメモリ方式はローカル開発には十分ですが、本番では適切なデータベースが必要です。SQLiteとその依存関係を追加しましょう。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:454
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Note>\n"
"If you're using `pnpm` as a package manager as suggeseted here, you should create a file called `pnpm-workspace.yaml` in the root of your project with the following content to ensure `better-sqlite3` is built correctly in the next step:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Note>\n"
"推奨通り`pnpm`をパッケージマネージャーとして使用している場合は、次のステップで`better-sqlite3`が正しくビルドされるように、次の内容を含む`pnpm-workspace.yaml`というファイルをプロジェクトのルートに作成する必要があります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:460
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"onlyBuiltDependencies:\n"
"  - better-sqlite3\n"
"```\n"
"</Note>\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"onlyBuiltDependencies:\n"
"  - better-sqlite3\n"
"```\n"
"</Note>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:465
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"pnpm add better-sqlite3 kysely\n"
"pnpm add -D @types/better-sqlite3 tsx\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"pnpm add better-sqlite3 kysely\n"
"pnpm add -D @types/better-sqlite3 tsx\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:467
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, replace the contents of `next.config.ts` to use `better-sqlite3` server-side:\n"
msgstr "次に、`next.config.ts`の内容を置き換えてサーバー側で`better-sqlite3`を使うようにします。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:470
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import type { NextConfig } from \"next\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import type { NextConfig } from \"next\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:474
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const nextConfig: NextConfig = {\n"
"  serverExternalPackages: [\"better-sqlite3\"],\n"
"};\n"
msgstr ""
"const nextConfig: NextConfig = {\n"
"  serverExternalPackages: [\"better-sqlite3\"],\n"
"};\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:477
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export default nextConfig;\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"export default nextConfig;\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:479
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then, add the actual database connection in `lib/db/index.ts`:\n"
msgstr "続いて、実際のデータベース接続を`lib/db/index.ts`に追加します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:483
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import Database from \"better-sqlite3\";\n"
"import { Kysely, SqliteDialect } from \"kysely\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import Database from \"better-sqlite3\";\n"
"import { Kysely, SqliteDialect } from \"kysely\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:485
#, no-wrap
msgid "const DATABASE_PATH = process.env.DATABASE_PATH || \"app.db\";\n"
msgstr "const DATABASE_PATH = process.env.DATABASE_PATH || \"app.db\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:487
#, no-wrap
msgid "let _db: Kysely<DatabaseSchema> | null = null;\n"
msgstr "let _db: Kysely<DatabaseSchema> | null = null;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:492
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export const getDb = (): Kysely<DatabaseSchema> => {\n"
"  if (!_db) {\n"
"    const sqlite = new Database(DATABASE_PATH);\n"
"    sqlite.pragma(\"journal_mode = WAL\");\n"
msgstr ""
"export const getDb = (): Kysely<DatabaseSchema> => {\n"
"  if (!_db) {\n"
"    const sqlite = new Database(DATABASE_PATH);\n"
"    sqlite.pragma(\"journal_mode = WAL\");\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:499
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    _db = new Kysely<DatabaseSchema>({\n"
"      dialect: new SqliteDialect({ database: sqlite }),\n"
"    });\n"
"  }\n"
"  return _db;\n"
"};\n"
msgstr ""
"    _db = new Kysely<DatabaseSchema>({\n"
"      dialect: new SqliteDialect({ database: sqlite }),\n"
"    });\n"
"  }\n"
"  return _db;\n"
"};\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:504
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export interface DatabaseSchema {\n"
"  auth_state: AuthStateTable;\n"
"  auth_session: AuthSessionTable;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"export interface DatabaseSchema {\n"
"  auth_state: AuthStateTable;\n"
"  auth_session: AuthSessionTable;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:509
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"interface AuthStateTable {\n"
"  key: string;\n"
"  value: string;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"interface AuthStateTable {\n"
"  key: string;\n"
"  value: string;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:515
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"interface AuthSessionTable {\n"
"  key: string;\n"
"  value: string;\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"interface AuthSessionTable {\n"
"  key: string;\n"
"  value: string;\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:517
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, create the \"migrations\" that you'll run to populate the database schema. Create `lib/db/migrations.ts`:\n"
msgstr "次に、データベーススキーマを作成するための\"migrations\"を作ります。`lib/db/migrations.ts`を作成してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { Kysely, Migration, Migrator } from \"kysely\";\n"
"import { getDb } from \".\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { Kysely, Migration, Migrator } from \"kysely\";\n"
"import { getDb } from \".\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:530
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const migrations: Record<string, Migration> = {\n"
"  \"001\": {\n"
"    async up(db: Kysely<unknown>) {\n"
"      await db.schema\n"
"        .createTable(\"auth_state\")\n"
"        .addColumn(\"key\", \"text\", (col) => col.primaryKey())\n"
"        .addColumn(\"value\", \"text\", (col) => col.notNull())\n"
"        .execute();\n"
msgstr ""
"const migrations: Record<string, Migration> = {\n"
"  \"001\": {\n"
"    async up(db: Kysely<unknown>) {\n"
"      await db.schema\n"
"        .createTable(\"auth_state\")\n"
"        .addColumn(\"key\", \"text\", (col) => col.primaryKey())\n"
"        .addColumn(\"value\", \"text\", (col) => col.notNull())\n"
"        .execute();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:543
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      await db.schema\n"
"        .createTable(\"auth_session\")\n"
"        .addColumn(\"key\", \"text\", (col) => col.primaryKey())\n"
"        .addColumn(\"value\", \"text\", (col) => col.notNull())\n"
"        .execute();\n"
"    },\n"
"    async down(db: Kysely<unknown>) {\n"
"      await db.schema.dropTable(\"auth_session\").execute();\n"
"      await db.schema.dropTable(\"auth_state\").execute();\n"
"    },\n"
"  },\n"
"};\n"
msgstr ""
"      await db.schema\n"
"        .createTable(\"auth_session\")\n"
"        .addColumn(\"key\", \"text\", (col) => col.primaryKey())\n"
"        .addColumn(\"value\", \"text\", (col) => col.notNull())\n"
"        .execute();\n"
"    },\n"
"    async down(db: Kysely<unknown>) {\n"
"      await db.schema.dropTable(\"auth_session\").execute();\n"
"      await db.schema.dropTable(\"auth_state\").execute();\n"
"    },\n"
"  },\n"
"};\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:554
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export function getMigrator() {\n"
"  const db = getDb();\n"
"  return new Migrator({\n"
"    db,\n"
"    provider: {\n"
"      getMigrations: async () => migrations,\n"
"    },\n"
"  });\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"export function getMigrator() {\n"
"  const db = getDb();\n"
"  return new Migrator({\n"
"    db,\n"
"    provider: {\n"
"      getMigrations: async () => migrations,\n"
"    },\n"
"  });\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:556
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, create `scripts/migrate.ts` so the migrations can be run from the command line:\n"
msgstr "次に、コマンドラインからマイグレーションを実行できるよう`scripts/migrate.ts`を作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:559
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { getMigrator } from \"@/lib/db/migrations\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { getMigrator } from \"@/lib/db/migrations\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:566
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"async function main() {\n"
"  const migrator = getMigrator();\n"
"  const { error } = await migrator.migrateToLatest();\n"
"  if (error) throw error;\n"
"  console.log(\"Migrations complete.\");\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"async function main() {\n"
"  const migrator = getMigrator();\n"
"  const { error } = await migrator.migrateToLatest();\n"
"  if (error) throw error;\n"
"  console.log(\"Migrations complete.\");\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:569 src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:761
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"main();\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"main();\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:571
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add those command line scrips to `package.json`:\n"
msgstr "これらのコマンドラインスクリプトを`package.json`に追加します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:584
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"scripts\": {\n"
"    \"dev\": \"pnpm migrate && next dev\",\n"
"    \"build\": \"next build\",\n"
"    \"start\": \"pnpm migrate && next start\",\n"
"    \"lint\": \"eslint\",\n"
"    // Add this line:\n"
"    \"migrate\": \"tsx scripts/migrate.ts\",\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"scripts\": {\n"
"    \"dev\": \"pnpm migrate && next dev\",\n"
"    \"build\": \"next build\",\n"
"    \"start\": \"pnpm migrate && next start\",\n"
"    \"lint\": \"eslint\",\n"
"    // Add this line:\n"
"    \"migrate\": \"tsx scripts/migrate.ts\",\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:586
#, no-wrap
msgid "And finally, update the `stateStore:` and `sessionStore` code blocks in `lib/auth/client.ts` to use the database. You'll need to import `getDb` at the top too:\n"
msgstr "最後に、`lib/auth/client.ts`の`stateStore:`と`sessionStore`のコードをデータベース用に更新します。先頭で`getDb`のimportも必要です。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:589
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { getDb } from \"../db\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { getDb } from \"../db\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:591
#, no-wrap
msgid "...\n"
msgstr "...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:616
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stateStore: {\n"
"  async get(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const row = await db\n"
"      .selectFrom(\"auth_state\")\n"
"      .select(\"value\")\n"
"      .where(\"key\", \"=\", key)\n"
"      .executeTakeFirst();\n"
"    return row ? JSON.parse(row.value) : undefined;\n"
"  },\n"
"  async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedState) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const valueJson = JSON.stringify(value);\n"
"    await db\n"
"      .insertInto(\"auth_state\")\n"
"      .values({ key, value: valueJson })\n"
"      .onConflict((oc) => oc.column(\"key\").doUpdateSet({ value: valueJson }))\n"
"      .execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"  async del(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    await db.deleteFrom(\"auth_state\").where(\"key\", \"=\", key).execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"},\n"
msgstr ""
"stateStore: {\n"
"  async get(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const row = await db\n"
"      .selectFrom(\"auth_state\")\n"
"      .select(\"value\")\n"
"      .where(\"key\", \"=\", key)\n"
"      .executeTakeFirst();\n"
"    return row ? JSON.parse(row.value) : undefined;\n"
"  },\n"
"  async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedState) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const valueJson = JSON.stringify(value);\n"
"    await db\n"
"      .insertInto(\"auth_state\")\n"
"      .values({ key, value: valueJson })\n"
"      .onConflict((oc) => oc.column(\"key\").doUpdateSet({ value: valueJson }))\n"
"      .execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"  async del(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    await db.deleteFrom(\"auth_state\").where(\"key\", \"=\", key).execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"},\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:642
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sessionStore: {\n"
"  async get(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const row = await db\n"
"      .selectFrom(\"auth_session\")\n"
"      .select(\"value\")\n"
"      .where(\"key\", \"=\", key)\n"
"      .executeTakeFirst();\n"
"    return row ? JSON.parse(row.value) : undefined;\n"
"  },\n"
"  async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedSession) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const valueJson = JSON.stringify(value);\n"
"    await db\n"
"      .insertInto(\"auth_session\")\n"
"      .values({ key, value: valueJson })\n"
"      .onConflict((oc) => oc.column(\"key\").doUpdateSet({ value: valueJson }))\n"
"      .execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"  async del(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    await db.deleteFrom(\"auth_session\").where(\"key\", \"=\", key).execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"sessionStore: {\n"
"  async get(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const row = await db\n"
"      .selectFrom(\"auth_session\")\n"
"      .select(\"value\")\n"
"      .where(\"key\", \"=\", key)\n"
"      .executeTakeFirst();\n"
"    return row ? JSON.parse(row.value) : undefined;\n"
"  },\n"
"  async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedSession) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    const valueJson = JSON.stringify(value);\n"
"    await db\n"
"      .insertInto(\"auth_session\")\n"
"      .values({ key, value: valueJson })\n"
"      .onConflict((oc) => oc.column(\"key\").doUpdateSet({ value: valueJson }))\n"
"      .execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"  async del(key: string) {\n"
"    const db = getDb();\n"
"    await db.deleteFrom(\"auth_session\").where(\"key\", \"=\", key).execute();\n"
"  },\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:644
#, no-wrap
msgid "All set! You can Ctrl+C the dev server if it's running, then start it again with:\n"
msgstr "以上です。開発サーバーが起動中ならCtrl+Cで停止し、次で再起動します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:650
#, no-wrap
msgid "You should see \"Migrations complete.\" and an `app.db` file created. Now this app will persist state and sessions across restarts.\n"
msgstr "\"Migrations complete.\"と表示され、`app.db`ファイルが作成されるはずです。これで再起動しても状態とセッションが保持されます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:652
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 4: Deploying to Production\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-4-deploying-to-production\">パート4：本番環境へのデプロイ</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:657
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For production, you need a \"confidential client\" instead of the loopback client you used. This requires:\n"
"- a public URL\n"
"- a private key for signing\n"
"- public endpoints for client metadata and JWKS\n"
msgstr ""
"本番環境では、これまでのループバッククライアントではなく「機密クライアント」が必要です。必要なものは次の通りです。\n"
"- 公開URL\n"
"- 署名用の秘密鍵\n"
"- クライアントメタデータとJWKSの公開エンドポイント\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:659
#, no-wrap
msgid "You don't need your own domain name to test the app at a public URL. You can host it on [Railway](https://railway.app/) by following our [deployment guide](https://github.com/bluesky-social/nextjs-oauth-tutorial/blob/main/RAILWAY_DEPLOY.md). First, follow these steps.\n"
msgstr "公開URLでアプリを試すのに独自ドメインは不要です。[デプロイガイド](https://github.com/bluesky-social/nextjs-oauth-tutorial/blob/main/RAILWAY_DEPLOY.md)に従って[Railway](https://railway.app/)へホスティングできます。まず以下の手順を進めてください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:661
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a `well-known` JWKS endpoint that advertises your client's public key at `app/.well-known/jwks.json/route.ts`:\n"
msgstr "`app/.well-known/jwks.json/route.ts`に、クライアント公開鍵を公開する`well-known` JWKSエンドポイントを作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:665
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { JoseKey } from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n"
"import { JoseKey } from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:668
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Serves the public keys for the OAuth client\n"
"// Required for confidential clients using private_key_jwt authentication\n"
msgstr ""
"// OAuthクライアントの公開鍵を配信する\n"
"// private_key_jwtを使う機密クライアントでは必須\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:670
#, no-wrap
msgid "const PRIVATE_KEY = process.env.PRIVATE_KEY;\n"
msgstr "const PRIVATE_KEY = process.env.PRIVATE_KEY;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:675
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function GET() {\n"
"  if (!PRIVATE_KEY) {\n"
"    return NextResponse.json({ keys: [] });\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function GET() {\n"
"  if (!PRIVATE_KEY) {\n"
"    return NextResponse.json({ keys: [] });\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:682
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  const key = await JoseKey.fromJWK(JSON.parse(PRIVATE_KEY));\n"
"  return NextResponse.json({\n"
"    keys: [key.publicJwk],\n"
"  });\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"  const key = await JoseKey.fromJWK(JSON.parse(PRIVATE_KEY));\n"
"  return NextResponse.json({\n"
"    keys: [key.publicJwk],\n"
"  });\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:684
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, update `lib/auth/client.ts` once more to use the confidential client configuration when in production:\n"
msgstr "次に、`lib/auth/client.ts`をもう一度更新し、本番時に機密クライアント設定を使うようにします。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:698
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import {\n"
"    JoseKey,\n"
"    Keyset,\n"
"    NodeOAuthClient,\n"
"    buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
"import type {\n"
"    NodeSavedSession,\n"
"    NodeSavedState,\n"
"    OAuthClientMetadataInput,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
"import { getDb } from \"../db\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import {\n"
"    JoseKey,\n"
"    Keyset,\n"
"    NodeOAuthClient,\n"
"    buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
"import type {\n"
"    NodeSavedSession,\n"
"    NodeSavedState,\n"
"    OAuthClientMetadataInput,\n"
"} from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
"import { getDb } from \"../db\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:705
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const PUBLIC_URL = process.env.PUBLIC_URL;\n"
"const PRIVATE_KEY = process.env.PRIVATE_KEY;\n"
msgstr ""
"const PUBLIC_URL = process.env.PUBLIC_URL;\n"
"const PRIVATE_KEY = process.env.PRIVATE_KEY;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:728
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"function getClientMetadata(): OAuthClientMetadataInput {\n"
"    if (PUBLIC_URL) {\n"
"        return {\n"
"            client_id: `${PUBLIC_URL}/oauth-client-metadata.json`,\n"
"            client_name: \"OAuth Tutorial\",\n"
"            client_uri: PUBLIC_URL,\n"
"            redirect_uris: [`${PUBLIC_URL}/oauth/callback`],\n"
"            grant_types: [\"authorization_code\", \"refresh_token\"],\n"
"            response_types: [\"code\"],\n"
"            scope: SCOPE,\n"
"            token_endpoint_auth_method: \"private_key_jwt\" as const,\n"
"            token_endpoint_auth_signing_alg: \"ES256\" as const, // must match the alg in scripts/gen-key.ts\n"
"            jwks_uri: `${PUBLIC_URL}/.well-known/jwks.json`,\n"
"            dpop_bound_access_tokens: true,\n"
"        };\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        return buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata({\n"
"            scope: SCOPE,\n"
"            redirect_uris: [\"http://127.0.0.1:3000/oauth/callback\"],\n"
"        });\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"function getClientMetadata(): OAuthClientMetadataInput {\n"
"    if (PUBLIC_URL) {\n"
"        return {\n"
"            client_id: `${PUBLIC_URL}/oauth-client-metadata.json`,\n"
"            client_name: \"OAuth Tutorial\",\n"
"            client_uri: PUBLIC_URL,\n"
"            redirect_uris: [`${PUBLIC_URL}/oauth/callback`],\n"
"            grant_types: [\"authorization_code\", \"refresh_token\"],\n"
"            response_types: [\"code\"],\n"
"            scope: SCOPE,\n"
"            token_endpoint_auth_method: \"private_key_jwt\" as const,\n"
"            token_endpoint_auth_signing_alg: \"ES256\" as const, // must match the alg in scripts/gen-key.ts\n"
"            jwks_uri: `${PUBLIC_URL}/.well-known/jwks.json`,\n"
"            dpop_bound_access_tokens: true,\n"
"        };\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        return buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata({\n"
"            scope: SCOPE,\n"
"            redirect_uris: [\"http://127.0.0.1:3000/oauth/callback\"],\n"
"        });\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:736
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"async function getKeyset(): Promise<Keyset | undefined> {\n"
"    if (PUBLIC_URL && PRIVATE_KEY) {\n"
"        return new Keyset([await JoseKey.fromJWK(JSON.parse(PRIVATE_KEY))]);\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        return undefined;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"async function getKeyset(): Promise<Keyset | undefined> {\n"
"    if (PUBLIC_URL && PRIVATE_KEY) {\n"
"        return new Keyset([await JoseKey.fromJWK(JSON.parse(PRIVATE_KEY))]);\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        return undefined;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:739
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export async function getOAuthClient(): Promise<NodeOAuthClient> {\n"
"    if (client) return client;\n"
msgstr ""
"export async function getOAuthClient(): Promise<NodeOAuthClient> {\n"
"    if (client) return client;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:745
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    client = new NodeOAuthClient({\n"
"        clientMetadata: getClientMetadata(),\n"
"        keyset: await getKeyset(),\n"
"...\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"    client = new NodeOAuthClient({\n"
"        clientMetadata: getClientMetadata(),\n"
"        keyset: await getKeyset(),\n"
"...\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:747
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will serve a [client metadata document](/specs/oauth#client-id-metadata-document).\n"
msgstr "これで[client metadata document](/specs/oauth#client-id-metadata-document)を配信できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:749
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, you'll need to generate a private key for signing. Create a script for that in `scripts/gen-key.ts`:\n"
msgstr "最後に、署名用の秘密鍵を生成する必要があります。`scripts/gen-key.ts`にスクリプトを作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:752
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { JoseKey } from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { JoseKey } from \"@atproto/oauth-client-node\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:758
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"async function main() {\n"
"  const kid = Date.now().toString();\n"
"  const key = await JoseKey.generate([\"ES256\"], kid);\n"
"  console.log(JSON.stringify(key.privateJwk));\n"
"};\n"
msgstr ""
"async function main() {\n"
"  const kid = Date.now().toString();\n"
"  const key = await JoseKey.generate([\"ES256\"], kid);\n"
"  console.log(JSON.stringify(key.privateJwk));\n"
"};\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:763
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add this script to `package.json`:\n"
msgstr "このスクリプトを`package.json`に追加します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:772
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"scripts\": {\n"
"    // Add this line:\n"
"    \"gen-key\": \"tsx scripts/gen-key.ts\",\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"scripts\": {\n"
"    // この行を追加\n"
"    \"gen-key\": \"tsx scripts/gen-key.ts\",\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:774
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the script as `pnpm gen-key` and save the output. This will be `PRIVATE_KEY`, one of two environment variables needed for your deployment:\n"
msgstr "`pnpm gen-key`でスクリプトを実行し、出力を保存してください。これが`PRIVATE_KEY`になり、デプロイに必要な2つの環境変数の1つです。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:779
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"PRIVATE_KEY={\"kty\":\"EC\",\"kid\":\"...\",\"alg\":\"ES256\",...}\n"
"PUBLIC_URL=https://your-app.example.com\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"PRIVATE_KEY={\"kty\":\"EC\",\"kid\":\"...\",\"alg\":\"ES256\",...}\n"
"PUBLIC_URL=https://your-app.example.com\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:781
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can provide these as part of our Railway [deployment guide](https://github.com/bluesky-social/nextjs-oauth-tutorial/blob/main/RAILWAY_DEPLOY.md). Follow those steps, and this app should then work from a public URL just like our [demo instance](https://nextjs-oauth-tutorial.up.railway.app/).\n"
msgstr "これらはRailwayの[デプロイガイド](https://github.com/bluesky-social/nextjs-oauth-tutorial/blob/main/RAILWAY_DEPLOY.md)に沿って設定できます。手順どおり進めれば、このアプリは[デモインスタンス](https://nextjs-oauth-tutorial.up.railway.app/)と同様に公開URLで動作するはずです。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:785
#, no-wrap
msgid "You now have a complete, production-deployed app with persistent storage. However, it doesn't actually do anything with the AT Protocol yet! As you add features from here, you'll need to request additional permission scopes during the OAuth flow.\n"
msgstr "これで永続ストレージ付きの本番デプロイ済みアプリが完成しました。ただし、まだATプロトコルを使った具体的な機能は実装していません。ここから機能を追加する際は、OAuthフローで追加の権限スコープを要求する必要があります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:787
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, the app requests only the `atproto` scope. The `atproto` scope is required and offers basic authentication for an `atproto` identity, but it does not authorize the client to access any privileged information or perform any actions on behalf of the user. Refer to the [Scopes guide](/guides/scopes) for more information.\n"
msgstr "デフォルトでは、アプリは`atproto`スコープのみを要求します。`atproto`スコープは必須で、`atproto` IDの基本認証を提供しますが、特権情報へのアクセスやユーザーの代理操作は許可しません。詳細は[スコープガイド](/guides/scopes)を参照してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:789
#, no-wrap
msgid "To change the requested scope, update the SCOPE constant in `lib/auth/client.ts`. It should be a space-delimited string:\n"
msgstr "要求するスコープを変更するには、`lib/auth/client.ts`のSCOPE定数を更新します。スペース区切り文字列で指定します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:793
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"export const SCOPE = \"atproto account:email repo:com.example.record\";\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"export const SCOPE = \"atproto account:email repo:com.example.record\";\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:795
#, no-wrap
msgid "This constant is used in three places:\n"
msgstr "この定数は次の3か所で使われます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:799
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The loopback client metadata (for local development)\n"
"- The production client metadata\n"
"- The login route's authorize call\n"
msgstr ""
"- ループバッククライアントメタデータ（ローカル開発用）\n"
"- 本番クライアントメタデータ\n"
"- ログインルートのauthorize呼び出し\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:801
#, no-wrap
msgid "By centralizing it in one constant, you only need to change it in one place. Now, when you log in to your app again, you'll be prompted to approve the additional scopes.\n"
msgstr "1つの定数に集約しておくことで、変更箇所は1か所で済みます。これで再度ログインすると、追加スコープの承認を求められます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-tutorial/en.mdx:802
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing this tutorial! You now have a solid Next.js foundation for building Atproto apps with OAuth. From here, you can move on to our [**Statusphere Example App Tutorial**](/guides/statusphere-tutorial).\n"
msgstr "おめでとうございます、チュートリアルは完了です。これでOAuthを使ったAtprotoアプリを作るための堅実なNext.js基盤ができました。次は[**Statusphereサンプルアプリチュートリアル**](/guides/statusphere-tutorial)に進めます。\n"
